  "reason": "Existing evidence shows that multi-profile RNA-only models with scvi_n200 encoder and avgpool aggregation (config_005, 0.650 accuracy) outperform other RNA-only baselines. This experiment tests whether transformer aggregation (instead of avgpool) improves performance with scvi_n200 in multi-profile settings. It isolates the effect of aggregation method, which remains uncertain despite prior results with PCA (config_003). This comparison directly addresses whether transformer aggregation offers benefits when paired with the stronger scvi_n200 encoder, providing critical insights into design choices without changing multiple variables."
